WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.451 --> 00:00:03.274
Unit seventeen. Study Habits!

2
00:00:04.229 --> 00:00:10.364
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level two!

3
00:00:10.414 --> 00:00:13.676
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.726 --> 00:00:17.107
Today we learn: Study Habits. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.532 --> 00:00:22.632
Study habit. Say it with me. Study habit!

6
00:00:26.051 --> 00:00:29.551
Focus. Say it with me. Focus!

7
00:00:33.095 --> 00:00:36.895
Organize. Say it with me. Organize!

8
00:00:40.408 --> 00:00:44.041
Review. Say it with me. Review!

9
00:00:47.535 --> 00:00:51.419
Distraction. Say it with me. Distraction!

10
00:00:54.951 --> 00:00:59.234
Concentration. Say it with me. Concentration!

11
00:01:02.706 --> 00:01:06.489
Schedule. Say it with me. Schedule!

12
00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:13.753
Improve. Say it with me. Improve!

13
00:01:17.252 --> 00:01:26.950
Grammar time! Gerund after preposition. Listen. I improve my grades by reviewing every night.

14
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:32.644
Your turn. Say it with me. I improve my grades by reviewing every night.

15
00:01:37.331 --> 00:01:49.381
Good study habits start with organizing your time and creating a schedule. Staying focused and avoiding distraction helps improve concentration. Reviewing your notes regularly makes a big difference.

16
00:01:49.431 --> 00:01:50.778
I like this story!

17
00:01:52.032 --> 00:01:57.367
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:57.417 --> 00:01:58.567
Organize!

19
00:01:59.546 --> 00:02:04.683
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:04.733 --> 00:02:05.883
Schedule!

21
00:02:06.914 --> 00:02:15.598
Think and answer. What is one study habit that helps you focus?

22
00:02:15.648 --> 00:02:16.864
Great answer!

23
00:02:18.132 --> 00:02:20.327
This unit's value is Discipline.

24
00:02:20.377 --> 00:02:22.768
I can show discipline every day!

25
00:02:23.948 --> 00:02:29.144
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:29.194 --> 00:02:31.106
